#
# The controller is a function behind the PCIe host bridge, the one loaded
# `pcie` instance (each board enables one bridge).
uses pci_v1 via component pcie { address, claim }
# The firmware loads the VL805's own firmware when told the controller was
# reset; its mailbox is found by the firmware node's compatible string.
uses mailbox_v1 via device compatible "raspberrypi,bcm2835-firmware", mboxes { property }
# In an image with the log server, the controller's trace goes to it on the
# interface's io-channel; elsewhere the import stays unlinked and the lines
# wait in the backlog `usb_hcd_v1.trace` drains.
uses log_v1 via component log_server { flush }
